   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(15)>ケーン・ワカバが、\n#c[5E8FD8]ドラグナー1型#cとともに艦を脱走し…\n敵に投降したのだ。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)><im(15)>Kaine Wakaba has fled the ship with\nthe #c[5E8FD8]Dragonar-1#c and...\nsurrendered to the enemy.",
   "notes": "Captain Sinapus speaking. 'ドラグナー1型' rendered as Dragonar-1."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63011#9",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>情報では、彼の母親である、\nアオイ・ワカバさんが\n人質に取られているらしい。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>According to our intel, his mother,\nAoi Wakaba, is apparently being held\nhostage.",
   "notes": "Captain Sinapus speaking. Aoi Wakaba identified from glossary."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63011#10",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>ケーンの件は置いておくにしても、\n民間人が人質に取られては\nうかつに手出しはできない。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>Setting Kaine's actions aside, with a\ncivilian held hostage, we cannot make\na careless move.",
   "notes": "Captain Sinapus speaking."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63011#11",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 37,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(37,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(11)>",
    "<im(12)>",
    "<im(13)>",
    "<im(7)>",
    "#c[5E8FD8]",
    "<im(8)>",
    "#c",
    "<im(9)>"
