   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>しかし、<im(11)>作戦<im(12)>は予<im(13)>定の時間に開始される。\n<im(7)>#c[5E8FD8]友軍<im(8)>艦#cの<im(9)>突入が始まったら、\n我々はその援護をしなくてはならない。",
   "en": "<op(37,1)><sp(2)>However, the <im(11)>operation <im(12)>begins <im(13)>on schedule.\nOnce <im(7)>#c[5E8FD8]allied <im(8)>ships#c <im(9)>begin their assault,\nwe must provide support for them.",
   "notes": "Captain Sinapus speaking. Preserved complex image and color token sequence strictly."
