    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>こうなってはやむをえん。\n#c[F07141]ケーンを敵とみなし、迎え撃つ#c！",
   "en": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>It can't be helped now.\n#c[F07141]Treat Kaine as hostile and engage him#c!",
   "notes": "Captain South Burning speaking."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63083#6",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 38,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(38,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>そして……\nできるだけ派手に戦闘して見せろ。\n敵の目を引くようにな。",
   "en": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>And one more thing...\nMake this fight look as flashy as you can.\nDraw the enemy's attention.",
   "notes": "Captain South Burning giving secretive orders to put on a show."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63083#7",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 38,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(38,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>わからんか？　実は、人質になった\nケーンの母親を救出する部隊が\nすでに向かっている。",
   "en": "<op(38,1)><sp(2)>Don't you get it? In truth, a team has\nalready been sent to rescue Kaine's\nmother from captivity.",
   "notes": "Captain South Burning revealing the true plan."
  },
